{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": {
    "text": "Quest 3 of 12",
    "font": "minecraft:default",
    "color": "gold",
    "bold": true
  },
  "external_title": {
    "text": "Quest 3",
    "font": "minecraft:default"
  },
  "pause": false,
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "after_action": "close",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 320,
      "contents": {
        "text": "",
        "font": "minecraft:default",
        "color": "white",
        "extra": [
          {
            "text": "Press a Button",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "gold"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Always Active",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " ran your command once, the moment you clicked ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Done",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ". To run a command at a different time, a command block needs a signal. In Minecraft, ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "redstone",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " creates the needed signal.",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "One way to create the redstone signal is using a ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "button",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ", which sends out a short burst of redstone energy that can trigger a command block.",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Your Mission",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " - Type ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "/give @s stone_button",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " and press Enter (any button would work). Open your command block, change the command to ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "give @p golden_apple",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ", and set the box on the right in the row of three boxes back to ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Needs Redstone",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " (in the last quest we changed it to ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Always Active",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "). Click ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Done",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ". Now put the button on the command block and press it.",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Hint",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " - You have to sneak (hold shift) while placing the button.",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Do you get a golden apple every time you press the button? If so, you've completed the quest! ",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "The next quest starts as soon as you've done it.",
            "font": "minecraft:default",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "text": "Continue",
      "font": "minecraft:default",
      "color": "green"
    }
  }
}
